text:
{
  "name": "橡實笛",
  "icon": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_flute_ember",
  "category": "adorablehamsterpets:accessories",
  "entry_color": "00AAAA",
  "sortnum": 3,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": {
        "item": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_flute_ember"
      },
      "link_recipe": true,
      "anchor": "acorn_flute",
      "text": "三款笛子都有相同用途：一段旋律就能分散附近苦力怕的注意力，並打斷$(l:the_hamster_life/redstone_fever)<dark_green><b>熱病倉鼠</>的攻擊。挑一款最搭你上衣的顏色吧。或搭帽子也行，隨你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "adorablehamsterpets:dynamic_page",
      "header": "倉鼠吹笛人",
      "header_color": "00AAAA",
      "text": "直接看著你的倉鼠吹笛，引導牠跳上肩膀。每次成功召回都會訓練牠，讓下次的反應更快。$(br2)此外，還藏著一個$(l:advanced_rodentry/musical_rodentry)<dark_green><b>音樂祕密</>。$(br2)配方 →",
      "text_color": "000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_flute_lush",
      "recipe2": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_flute_ember"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:crafting",
      "recipe": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_flute_harmony",
      "recipe2": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_flute_harmony_mirrored"
    }
  ]
}

