text:
{
  "name": "橡實帽",
  "icon": "adorablehamsterpets:acorn_hat",
  "category": "adorablehamsterpets:accessories",
  "entry_color": "00AAAA",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "adorablehamsterpets:dynamic_page",
      "header": "橡實帽",
      "header_color": "00AAAA",
      "text_color": "000000",
      "text": "將<dark_green><b>堅果帽</>放入$(l:advanced_rodentry/cheek_pouches#equipment_slots)<dark_green><b>飾品</>欄，讓倉鼠變身樹棲動物：$(l:advanced_rodentry/tree_heist_and_armor#intro)<dark_green><b>葉間掠奪</>產出的物品數量增加。$(br2)讓它看起來像顆堅果也許能讓它注意到先前沒發現的橡實。或者只是因為它們穿著好看的衣服會更喜歡幹活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:image",
      "title": "",
      "images": [
        "adorablehamsterpets:patchouli_books/hamster_tips_guide_book/images/accessories/accessory_acorn_hat.png"
      ],
      "border": false,
      "text": "   這帽子簡直精妙到$(br)“<i>讓人瘋狂</>”$(br)  還有，“<i>變多</>”。"
    }
  ]
}

