text:
{
  "name": "口中飾品",
  "icon": "minecraft:gold_nugget",
  "category": "adorablehamsterpets:loot_and_scavenging",
  "entry_color": "00AAAA",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "adorablehamsterpets:dynamic_page",
      "header": "口中飾品",
      "header_color": "00AAAA",
      "text": "野生倉鼠是智慧掃地機器人。它們有一半的機率口含物品生成。$(br2)裡面可能有隨處可見的$(l:crops_food)<dark_green><b>種子</>、金屬顆粒、蔬菜和其他小東西。它們很害羞，所以記得帶上點$(br)  $(l:advanced_rodentry/cheek_pouches)<dark_green><b>好喫的</>。",
      "text_color": "000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(br)不喜歡它們的收納品味，想讓它們的嘴裡吐出象牙？$(br2)你現在有這機會改變一切。你可以在$(l:the_kitchen_drawer/config_heaven)<dark_green><b>設定介面</> 中修改它嘴裡生成的物品。"
    }
  ]
}

